138
00:21:58.510 --> 00:22:19.179
Tricia Wang (Advanced AI Society): And really, this is the new shift that needs to be made, where we're moving from the current kind of claims-based AI world, which is based on assertions, kind of what we call trust me bro AI, to what needs to happen to tomorrow, which is how about we trust no bros, and what we can trust other mechanisms of verification. So we call that verifiable AI, where we focus on evidence and deployment.

