144
00:23:23.300 --> 00:23:42.799
Tricia Wang (Advanced AI Society): And so, in that distance, the verifiability gap is the distance between what anyone can openly verify and what agents do, and we need to close this gap. So our goals at the Society are to make sure that we make verifiable AI open, publicly definable, we want it natively embedded in infrastructure, commercially procurable.

145
00:23:42.800 --> 00:23:59.600
